{
  "_doc": "AWF market monitor config. Add YouTube channels as '@handle' or full URLs to `channels`; subreddits like 'EnglishLearning' to `subreddits`; competitor app ids to `apps`; article/blog URLs to `urls`. Run: .venv/bin/python -m yt2nlm monitor state/monitor-awf.config.json [--init|--dry-run]",
